            updateNode: "当主角从当前所在区域离开时，更新所在地点。每轮必须更新时间。\nSQL示例: UPDATE global_state SET current_location = '新地点', prev_scene_time = cur_time, cur_time = '2024-03-15 16:00', elapsed_time = '约1小时' WHERE row_id = 1;",
